# Repository-specific path prefixes exempt from the check-typography action,
# one per line, relative to the repository root. Read alongside the managed
# .typography-allow; this file is repo-owned and survives template sync.
# The stream fuzzer feeds deliberately non-ASCII inputs (CJK, RTL, emoji)
# through the SSE parser; those strings are test data, not typography. They
# live in fuzzStream.ts (shared by the docker fuzzer and the property
# suites), and both files keep their box-drawing section dividers.
src/test/docker-fuzz.test.ts
src/test/fuzzStream.ts
# The text-token estimator prices fullwidth forms and non-Latin scripts, so
# its suite feeds them as literals: fullwidth digits for the two-band test,
# Cyrillic homoglyphs for the script-detection test. Test data, not typography.
src/test/bun/shared/conversion/textTokens.test.ts
